  "id": "hub.gzh-design",
  "kind": "skill",
  "name": "GZH Design",
  "summary": "WeChat Official Account article layout engine: turns Markdown (or docx/PDF/plain text, normalized first) into polished HTML with fully inlined styles that survive pasting into the WeChat editor. Six curated themes (Moyu Green, Red & White, Graphite Minimal, Zen Whitespace, Moyu Ticket, Olive Journal), each a self-contained component library behind a single-source theme index, plus a theme generator for custom styles; auto section numbers, keyword underline marks, intro cards, TOC, code blocks, images/GIFs and author signature. Two deterministic local quality gates (component lint, WeChat platform limits) and a preview wrap before paste. Use when laying out WeChat articles; not for ordinary web pages, landing pages or slides. Source-pointing carry of isjiamu/gzh-design-skill at the pinned commit: only the skill surface (SKILL.md, references, scripts, assets), not archive/, docs/ or repo meta. Licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later (copyleft applies to the skill's source).",
  "summaryI18n": {
    "zh-CN": "微信公众号文章排版引擎：把 Markdown（或先归一化的 docx/PDF/纯文本）转成可直接粘进公众号编辑器、粘贴后样式不丢失的内联样式 HTML。六套精选主题（摸鱼绿、红白色系、石墨极简风、留白禅意风、摸鱼票据风、橄榄手记）各自为完整组件库，由单一来源主题索引登记，另附按描述/参考图生成自定义主题的主题生成器；支持自动章节编号、关键词下划线标记、引言卡片、目录导航、代码块、图片/GIF 与作者签名；由仅标准库的本地 Python 脚本执行组件审查与公众号平台限制双关卡校验，附带粘贴前预览包装。适用于公众号文章排版；不用于普通网页、落地页或 PPT。自 isjiamu/gzh-design-skill 钉住 commit 来源指向携带，仅携带技能面（SKILL.md、references、scripts、assets），不含 archive/、docs/ 与仓库元文件。许可证 AGPL-3.0-or-later：强著左条款作用于本技能源码。"
  },
